        "content",
        "infrastructure"
      ],
      "url": "https://cube001.atlassian.net/browse/CPN-196",
      "panels": [
        {
          "type": "info",
          "text": "16/11/26    Dev, Test and Prod environments are provisioned and live in Azure. SQL MI for Content Dev and Test have been provisioned. Dev SQL migration has been completed and all config changes completed. Entra authentication is in use. Test migration is planned to take place 24/11, further planning is required for Production migration. On prem Prod1 SQL servers need to be upgraded to be compatible with SQL MI Link. New nodes to be created and added to cluster. A new Azure SQL database is also required to be compatible with running SQL MI Link in Production."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "CPN-610",
