      ],
      "url": "https://cube001.atlassian.net/browse/CPN-610",
      "panels": [
        {
          "type": "info",
          "text": "16/11/26 All CUBE repos have been migrated to GHE and pipelines relinked to use GHE. Kodex and 4CRisk migrations have been completed. Remaining Acin repos need pre migration work to be completed so they can be migrated sucesfully. The Golden Pipeline and AI Skills have been created and documented. Self migration model has been adopted with the engineering teams to migrate pipelines themselves with support from the team. Blocking of Critical, High and Medium security vulnerabilities has been enabled. Blocking of Low is scheduled for 25/11."
        }
      ]
